sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as Platform Orchestrator<br/>(DSC)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reconciler as WorkbenchesReconciler<br/>controller-runtime
    participant WebhookSvc as Webhook Service<br/>443/TCP → 9443
    participant ConnWH as NotebookWebhook<br/>(Connection Secrets)
    participant HWWH as HardwareProfile Injector
    participant User as User / kubectl

    Note over Orchestrator,Reconciler: Reconciliation Flow
    Orchestrator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Workbenches CR<br/>(platform, gatewayDomain, mlflowEnabled)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Watch event (Workbenches CR changed)
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Read odh-workbenches-config ConfigMap<br/>(distribution name, version)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: ConfigMap data
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Render kustomize manifests<br/>(platform-specific params)
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Server-side apply:<br/>Deployments, Services, RBAC,<br/>ConfigMaps, Secrets, Webhooks
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Apply result
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update Workbenches CR status

    Note over User,HWWH: Webhook Admission Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Notebook CR
    K8sAPI->>WebhookSvc: Admission request<br/>HTTPS/443 → 9443<br/>TLS (service-ca cert)

    WebhookSvc->>ConnWH: Route: /workbenches-connection-notebook
    ConnWH->>K8sAPI: GET Secret (validate connection secrets exist)
    K8sAPI-->>ConnWH: Secret data
    ConnWH->>K8sAPI: Create SubjectAccessReview<br/>(check user can read secrets)
    K8sAPI-->>ConnWH: SAR result (allowed/denied)
    alt SAR allowed
        ConnWH->>ConnWH: Inject volume mounts<br/>for connection secrets
        ConnWH-->>WebhookSvc: Admit with patches
    else SAR denied
        ConnWH-->>WebhookSvc: Deny admission
    end

    WebhookSvc->>HWWH: Route: /workbenches-hardware-profile
    HWWH->>K8sAPI: GET HardwareProfile CR
    K8sAPI-->>HWWH: HardwareProfile spec
    HWWH->>HWWH: Mutate container resource limits
    HWWH-->>WebhookSvc: Admit with patches

    WebhookSvc-->>K8sAPI: Combined admission response
    K8sAPI-->>User: Notebook CR created/updated

    Note over Reconciler,K8sAPI: TLS Bootstrap Flow
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: GET APIServer TLS security profile
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: TLS profile (ciphers, min version)
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Configure webhook + metrics TLS<br/>(or fallback: Mozilla Intermediate, TLS 1.2)
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Register SecurityProfileWatcher
    Note right of Reconciler: On TLS profile change:<br/>cancel context → pod restart
